    "content": {
      "id": "6abf40d99ed1202b9b8fb4fb",
      "meta": {
        "version": "0.0.3"
      },
      "zone": "ncs",
      "boardRef": "6a2629f436bfe25a75cb4c82",
      "content": "<div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fb140f17-9f73aad9-e39d-4e97-b3b7-5c4eeafea3ca&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fb140f17-9f73aad9-e39d-4e97-b3b7-5c4eeafea3ca\" alt=\"announcements_EN.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Twitch Drops Account Linking Guide</strong></span></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">The account you link to Twitch <strong>must be the account you're currently playing AION2 on.</strong></div><ul><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">If you're playing on <strong>Steam </strong>→ Link your <strong>Steam account</strong></div></li><li><div data-contents-type=\"text\">If you're playing on <strong>NC (Purple)</strong> → Link your <strong>NC (Purple) account</strong></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div></li></ul><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Linking a different account may result in not receiving your Twitch Drops.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Even if rewards are not granted, do not separately link your account on the NC website. Doing so may unlink your existing connection, and you may become unable to access your existing character.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">If you become unable to access your character, please check the <a href=\"https://help.plaync.com/faq/aion2global?faqNo=7240\" title=\"https://help.plaync.com/faq/aion2global?faqno=7240\" target=\"_blank\">FAQ</a> for how to resolve this.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">For more details on Twitch Drops, please refer to the <a href=\"https://aion2.plaync.com/en-us/twitchdrops/index\" title=\"https://aion2.plaync.com/en-us/twitchdrops/index\" target=\"_blank\">FAQ</a>.</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fb1447c3-4d966d51-b3c4-4514-99d8-b45fce9a3f1c&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fb1447c3-4d966d51-b3c4-4514-99d8-b45fce9a3f1c\" alt=\"Bottom banner.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div>",
